note Contract section 4 lines 114-116: a rolled loop is not unrolled, so its one trap site (the run-time
note divisor a, trap 2) is recorded once with iter=-, at line 10. Function mode. Expected exp/diag-site-rolled.err.
note
note
om2 diag
fn f a ulong to ulong
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 3
s = add s div i a
end
ret s
end
